{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28926","headline":"郁林寺 · 许浑","name":"郁林寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台殿冠嵯峨，春来日日过。\n水分诸院少，云近上方多。\n衆籁凝丝竹，繁英耀绮罗。\n酒酣诗自逸，乘月棹寒波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}